hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"230","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mujh par ek bar durud bheje Allah us par das bar rahmat bhejta hai. [Nabi par durud ki fazeelat]"
"231","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri qabr ko eid na banao aur mujh par durud bhejo; tumhara durud mujhe pahunchta hai jahan bhi ho. [Nabi par durud ki fazeelat]"
"232","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bakheel woh hai jis ke samne mera zikr ho aur mujh par durud na bheje. [Nabi par durud ki fazeelat]"
"233","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ke saiyah farishte zameen mein phirte hain jo meri ummat ka salam mujhe pahunchate hain. [Nabi par durud ki fazeelat]"
"234","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mujh par salam bheje Allah meri ruh lautata hai yahan tak ke main us ke salam ka jawab dun. [Nabi par durud ki fazeelat]"
